@FileInspector.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Find duplicate file names under the configured Files directory
GET {{FileInspector.API_HostAddress}}/api/files/duplicates
Accept: application/json

###

### Find duplicate file names under a subdirectory of Files
GET {{FileInspector.API_HostAddress}}/api/files/duplicates?path=Samples
Accept: application/json

###

### Inspect a file (replace the path with a local file)
POST {{FileInspector.API_HostAddress}}/api/files/inspect
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=FileInspectorBoundary

--FileInspectorBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="README.md"
Content-Type: text/markdown

< ../README.md
--FileInspectorBoundary--
